408 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Environmental psychology applied to residential development\056 How natural light\054 green corridors\054 community layout\054 and pathway design affect the daily experience of living in a space \024 and therefore its long\055term value and resale appeal\056 Draws on published research\056 Explains the specific design decisions at Oltraya Verde and why they were made\056 Written by Chandni Rav \024 the behavioural science background gives this article genuine authority that no generic marketing copy can replicate\056)
     /K [ 8 ]
     /P 409 0 R
     /Pg 392 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
