412 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Q\072  What is environmental psychology in real estate\077\nA\072  The study of how the design of built environments affects human behaviour\054 wellbeing\054 and quality of life\056\n\nQ\072  Does plot orientation matter when buying land\077\nA\072  Yes significantly\056 East or northeast facing plots receive morning light\054 which research consistently associates with better sleep quality and wellbeing\056 Ask your developer for the orientation specifications of available plots\056\n\nQ\072  What is a green corridor in residential development\077\nA\072  A planned landscaped pathway or planting strip that connects open spaces within a development\056 Green corridors reduce ambient temperature\054 reduce noise\054 and create natural community gathering points\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 413 0 R
     /Pg 392 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

